    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "On choosing a friendly ASTRA MILITARUM unit to shoot, you may nominate a visible enemy unit no farther than 18″ from it. If you do, that shooter must direct its ranged attacks at the nominee. For the balance of the phase, friendly GENESTEALER CULTS models gain +1 on ranged Hit rolls against that enemy.",
